                  coreCompetencies: "CP 5.4: Generate hypothesis to help solve complex problems; CP 6.4: Ability to identify important and appropriate criteria and use them to evaluate available alternatives; PL 5.5: Desire to accept one's true self and overcome weaknesses; PL 5.6: Ability to set and maintain standards and values.",
